        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>班队会记录</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #efe9e0;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f5f0e8;\n    padding: 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .top-strip {\n    height: 40px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #b9b2a6;\n    color: #9a938a;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    padding: 4px 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .main {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .left-col {\n    width: 470px;\n    padding: 8px 6px 0 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .right-col {\n    width: 70px;\n    padding-top: 42px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    border-left: 1px solid #cfc8bc;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    margin: 6px 0 8px 0;\n    font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  table.rec {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n  }\n  table.rec td {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    padding: 4px 6px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  td.label {\n    width: 58px;\n    text-align: center;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .hand {\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", cursive, serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #1a1a3a;\n  }\n  .cell-tall { height: 90px; vertical-align: top; }\n  .cell-process { height: 250px; vertical-align: top; }\n  .cell-effect { height: 110px; vertical-align: top; }\n  .cell-note { height: 55px; vertical-align: middle; }\n  .indent { text-indent: 2em; }\n  .big { font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 3px; }\n  .right-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n  }\n  .right-table td {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    border-left: none;\n    border-right: none;\n    padding: 4px 4px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .r-tall { height: 90px; }\n  .r-proc { height: 250px; }\n  .page-num {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #555;\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    padding-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    color: #8a8378;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"top-strip\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"height:30px; line-height:30px;\">[Photo: 上一页手写文字残影，顶部]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"main\">\n    <div class=\"left-col\">\n      <h1 class=\"title\">班队会记录</h1>\n      <table class=\"rec\">\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">时&nbsp;间</td>\n          <td class=\"hand\" style=\"width:120px;\">2023.5.22</td>\n          <td class=\"label\" style=\"width:70px;\">班级（中队）</td>\n          <td class=\"hand\">五(3) 中队</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">主&nbsp;题</td>\n          <td class=\"hand big\" colspan=\"3\">争做良好习惯的小标兵</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">目&nbsp;的<br>要&nbsp;求</td>\n          <td class=\"hand cell-tall\" colspan=\"3\">\n            <div class=\"indent\">教育归根结底是培养习惯，养成习惯，习惯是行为的自动化。习惯一旦养成，就会成为支配人生的一种力量。通过本次班队会，就是要培养同学们的良好习惯。</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">过<br><br><br><br>程</td>\n          <td class=\"hand cell-process\" colspan=\"3\">\n            一、观看事例<br>\n            故事告诉我们的道理：世界上，最可怕的力量是习惯，世界上，最宝贵的财富也是习惯。<br>\n            二、《小品&lt;&lt;发生在我们身边的事&gt;&gt;》<br>\n            三、怎样告别坏习惯。<br>\n            四、分享好习惯<br>\n            五、养成好习惯。\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">效<br>果</td>\n          <td class=\"hand cell-effect\" colspan=\"3\">\n            <div class=\"indent\">今天的班队会开得很成功，相信大家也受到了很大的教育和促动，我相信我们的后校今更加美好。</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">备&nbsp;注</td>\n          <td class=\"hand big cell-note\" colspan=\"3\">争做良好习惯</td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n      <div class=\"page-num\">- 46 -</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-col\">\n      <table class=\"right-table\">\n        <tr><td>时&nbsp;间</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>主&nbsp;题</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"r-tall\">目&nbsp;的<br>要&nbsp;求</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"r-proc\">过</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
